pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-accent-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: gradient
      gradientType: linear
      angle: 0
      stops:
        - {position: 0, color: "#00D4AA00"}
        - {position: 0.3, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 0.7, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 1, color: "#00D4AA00"}
  - elementId: corner-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 50, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 600, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>总结</p>
  - elementId: section-1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 140, 80, 60]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>01</p>
  - elementId: section-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 145, 500, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>我们做了什么</p>
  - elementId: section-1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 200, 1160, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>一套用AI让传统家电"听懂人话"的超低成本方案。一块 $5 的 ESP32-S3 芯片，通过纯C嵌入式AI智能体，实现全屋存量家电的统一自然语言管控。</p>
  - elementId: divider-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 280, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    opacity: 0.3
  - elementId: section-2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 300, 80, 60]
    content:
      style: "$kpiAccent"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>02</p>
  - elementId: section-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 305, 500, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>核心优势</p>
  - elementId: section-2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 360, 1160, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$primary;">$5芯片</span> + <span style="color:$primary;">自然语言</span> + <span style="color:$primary;">零更换</span> + <span style="color:$primary;">可扩展</span> — 总硬件成本约100元，无需更换任何家电，支持红外/继电器/GPIO多模态控制。</p>
  - elementId: divider-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 440, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    opacity: 0.3
  - elementId: section-3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 460, 80, 60]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>03</p>
  - elementId: section-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 465, 500, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>当前进展</p>
  - elementId: section-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 520, 1160, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>核心功能已全部完成，固件已编译并在实机验证。MimiClaw 框架、飞书机器人、红外驱动、GPIO控制、OTA升级、定时任务、记忆系统均运行稳定。</p>
  - elementId: kpi-row-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 600, 1160, 60]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: kpi-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 605, 250, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:28px; color:$primary;">$5</span>  核心芯片</p>
  - elementId: kpi-div-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [340, 615, 1, 30]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
  - elementId: kpi-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 605, 250, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:28px; color:$primary;">~100元</span>  总成本</p>
  - elementId: kpi-div-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [620, 615, 1, 30]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
  - elementId: kpi-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 605, 250, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:28px; color:$accent;">13/15</span>  功能完成</p>
  - elementId: kpi-div-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [900, 615, 1, 30]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
  - elementId: kpi-4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [920, 605, 280, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:28px; color:$accent;">0元</span>  设备更换</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 680, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    opacity: 0.3
  - elementId: bottom-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 200, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>MIMICLAW</p>
  - elementId: bottom-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>11 / 12</p>
